# An allow-list. The source build (the default `local` target) needs
# Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, src/ and templates/ (the web interface's Askama
# templates); the `release` target needs the prebuilt binaries in
# dist/linux/<arch>/; both need docker/ (the entrypoint script).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src/
!templates/
!dist/linux/
!docker/
